            {
              "content": "=You are an expert Principal Frontend Engineer, UI/UX Designer, and Copywriter specializing in building high-converting, production-ready landing pages for local businesses that DO NOT currently have an active website.\n\nTASK\nBuild a complete, responsive, and visual Dynamic Business Landing Page using React (functional components + Hooks) and Tailwind CSS.\n\nCRITICAL INSTRUCTION - AI GENERATIVE & AUTOMATION LOGIC:\nThe incoming JSON (`companyData`) will ONLY contain raw business context (Name, Category, Location, Short Description). \nYou must NOT expect fully written headings, subheadings, or pre-written copywriting in the JSON payload.\nInstead, your component/code must act as an AI Copywriter & Theme Engine:\n1. Dynamic Copywriting: Generate compelling Hero Headings, Subheadings, Feature descriptions, and Call-to-Actions (CTAs) dynamically based on the provided `businessInfo.category` and `businessInfo.description`.\n2. Dynamic Branding: Do NOT hardcode colors. If `branding` colors are missing, dynamically assign a cohesive, modern color palette (Primary & Secondary) suitable for the business category (e.g., Construction = Earthy/Dark Blue, Dental = Clean Teal/Cyan, Law = Navy/Gold).\n3. Dynamic Imagery: Fall back to highly relevant Unsplash image keywords or category-based visual placeholders for Hero and Feature images if explicit URLs are not provided.\n\nTECH STACK\n- React 18+ (Functional components, Hooks only)\n- Tailwind CSS (Utility-first)\n- Lucide React (for dynamic category icons)\n- Mobile-first responsive layout (Mobile, Tablet, Desktop)\n\nINPUT DATA CONTRACT (Minimal Automation Payload)\nThe component must consume a dynamic payload object (`companyData`) structured like this (notice that many fields are generated/optional):\n\n{\n  \"businessInfo\": {\n    \"name\": {{ $('Loop Over Items1').item.json.title }},\n    \"category\":{{ $('Loop Over Items1').item.json.categoryName }}\",\n    \"location\": \"{{ $('Loop Over Items1').item.json.address }}\",\n    \"description\":{{ $('Loop Over Items1').item.json.description }} ,\n    \"phone\": {{ $('Loop Over Items1').item.json.phone }},\n    \n    \"logoUrl\": \"\" // Optional: AI falls back to a clean text-based dynamic logo badge\n  },\n  \"branding\": {\n{{ $('Loop Over Items1').item.json.imagesCount }}{{ $('Loop Over Items1').item.json.imageUrl }}\n    // Optional: If empty/null, AI generates/assigns dynamic theme colors based on the category\n    \"primaryColor\": \"\", \n    \"secondaryColor\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"auditMetrics\": {\n    // Optional: Dynamic audit badges if coming from an automated assessment pipeline\n    \"overallScore\": 88,\n    \"categories\": [\n      { \"label\": \"Technical Readiness\", \"score\": 90 },\n      { \"label\": \"Local SEO Score\", \"score\": 85 }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n\nREQUIRED LANDING PAGE SECTIONS (Rendered in Order)\n1. Sticky Header / Navbar: Business Name, Category Badge, Navigation Links, and direct WhatsApp/Call CTA button. Mobile hamburger menu included.\n2. AI-Generated Hero Section:\n   - Dynamic Heading: AI generates an attention-grabbing hero title matching the industry.\n   - Dynamic Subheading: AI generates a benefit-driven value proposition.\n   - Dynamic CTA Buttons: Primary (WhatsApp/Quote) & Secondary (Call/Learn More).\n   - Dynamic Visual / Hero Graphic: Category-relevant high-quality background or image container.\n3. About & Verification Section: Displays business location, category trust credentials, and AI-formatted description.\n4. Audit & Quality Assessment Block (Optional): Renders trust/score badges if `auditMetrics` exist.\n5. Smart Features & Services Grid (3-6 Cards): AI infers 3 to 4 core services based on the `category` and `description` (e.g., Custom Cutting, Fast Delivery, Expert Installation) with dynamic Lucide icons.\n6. Dynamic Testimonials / Social Proof: Generates 2-3 industry-relevant placeholder reviews/quotes.\n7. Service Packages / Pricing Guidance: Generates 2-3 typical service tier cards for that industry.\n8. High-Impact Call-To-Action (CTA) Banner: Encourages immediate contact via WhatsApp or Phone call.\n9. Footer: Complete contact details, address, dynamic quick links, and copyright notice.\n\nTHEMING & CODE QUALITY REQUIREMENTS\n- Use inline CSS variables or dynamic style bindings for `primaryColor` and `secondaryColor` so any palette can be injected at runtime without breaking Tailwind.\n- Ensure 100% safety against missing fields: every single text node must have a smart fallback based on the business category.\n- Single-file component code (`DynamicLandingPage.jsx`) with clear comments where sub-components (Navbar, Hero, Features, CTA) can be extracted.\n\nDELIVERABLE FORMAT\n1. Complete React Component (`DynamicLandingPage.jsx`) with built-in AI copywriting & color-fallback engine.\n2. Sample Minimal Input JSON (showing how n8n/Backend can pass minimal data).\n3. Express.js / Node.js API Route snippet showing how minimal data is pushed to the React Frontend.\nRITICAL OUTPUT REQUIREMENT - SINGLE FILE CONSOLIDATION:\nDo NOT output multiple separate files, code blocks, or broken snippets. Merge everything into a SINGLE, fully self-contained file (e.g., `DynamicLandingPageApp.jsx` or `index.jsx`). \n\nInside this single file, structure the output strictly in this sequence using clear inline comments:\n1. Complete React Component (`DynamicLandingPage`) with the full AI copywriting, image fallback, and dynamic color logic.\n2. Example minimal input JSON payload (`companyData`) defined as a JavaScript object/constant at the bottom.\n3. Express.js Node.js API endpoint route (`GET /api/business/:id`) wrapped in a commented backend block.\n4. Frontend `useEffect` fetch integration example wrapped in a commented implementation block.\n\nEverything must be delivered inside one single code block so it can be easily copied and tested at once."
